## Learning Objectives

- Investigate an AI/ML supply-chain incident
- Analyse deployment logs to establish a timeline
- Decompile and inspect malicious model files (pickle / .h5)
- Identify embedded payloads and exfiltration behaviour
- Correlate evidence across logs and model artefacts

